pretty (the Meadow package) is a port of the Rust crate pretty
(https://github.com/Marwes/pretty.rs), version 0.12.5, by Jonathan Sterling,
Darin Morrison, Markus Westerlind and contributors, to Meadow. Its test cases
are generated from that crate, and its code is translated from its source.

pretty is licensed under the MIT license, and so is this port: see LICENSE
(pretty's).
